==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|sh}} {{term/t|la|acadēmīa}}, from {{etyl|grc|sh}} {{term|lang=grc|Ἀκαδημία|tr=Akadēmia}}, a grove of trees and gymnasium outside of Athens where [[w:Plato|Plato]] taught; from the name of the supposed former owner of that estate, the [[w:Attica|Attic]] hero [[w:Akademos|Akademos]].

